    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: 0
    text: Oh, come on! This line is taking forever!
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: 0
    text: I've been waiting for ages!
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 2
    actor: 0
    text: 
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: Angry
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 3
    actor: 0
    text: How is Mr. Karim feeling?
    emotion: 3
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: Mr. Karim is angry, or frustrated. His eyebrows are pulled down and his mouth is tight.
    hint: 'Look at his eyebrows: they are pulled down low, and his voice is loud. Is that a calm, happy face?'
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 4
    actor: 0
    text: You are waiting in line too. What should you do?
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options:
    - label: Wait calmly for my turn
      icon: {fileID: -3971163059403916615, guid: ff2f0e896dae54ae0b6d36485f075998, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.8627451, g: 0.9254902, b: 1, a: 1}
    - label: Push to the front
      icon: {fileID: 2225147479360031196, guid: f29a88addbf3e4974adefbbcaf7f5ced, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.8627451, b: 0.8392157, a: 1}
    - label: Shout too
      icon: {fileID: -365116588634130010, guid: 43dedd82599b54b7fbd5112490dffd1c, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.94509804, b: 0.72156864, a: 1}
    - label: Run around the shop
      icon: {fileID: 1751989451324975719, guid: 601d6ab3f7ab44a9ca3c25fc9d8ef5af, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.9019608, b: 0.9411765, a: 1}
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Great waiting!
    praise: Standing calmly and taking turns is the right thing to do, even when others are upset.
    hint: Pushing, shouting or running around would make things harder for everyone. What is the calm way to wait?
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 1
    actor: 0
    text: 
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 2
    actor: 0
    text: 
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: Trolley
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: 0
    text: Hmm. You're right, waiting calmly is better. Sorry for shouting.
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 1
    actor: 1
    text: 
    emotion: 1
    strength: 0.85
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: 1
    text: Thank you both for waiting so nicely. Hello there!
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
    praise: 
    hint: 
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 4
    actor: 1
    text: Nora the cashier says hello. What do you say?
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options:
    - label: Hello! Thank you.
      icon: {fileID: -9177688378615845763, guid: b68317e49a9de46e0b3ffcc9cdfde4d7, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.8745098, g: 0.9529412, b: 0.8901961, a: 1}
    - label: Say nothing
      icon: {fileID: 938587893661617443, guid: e7eaa64d31b364ddb8416abf387f0ae6, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.9019608, b: 0.9411765, a: 1}
    - label: Give me my things!
      icon: {fileID: -365116588634130010, guid: 43dedd82599b54b7fbd5112490dffd1c, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.8627451, b: 0.8392157, a: 1}
    - label: Walk away
      icon: {fileID: 1751989451324975719, guid: 601d6ab3f7ab44a9ca3c25fc9d8ef5af, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.94509804, b: 0.72156864, a: 1}
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Lovely manners!
    praise: Saying hello and thank you makes people feel happy, and it's how we talk to a cashier.
    hint: When someone says hello, we say hello back. Which answer is friendly and polite?
    seconds: 1
  - kind: 0
    actor: -1
    text: Hello! Thank you.
    emotion: 0
    strength: 1
    state: 
    options: []
    correctOption: 0
    praiseTitle: Yes, that's right!
